        <owl:annotatedTarget xml:lang="en">x is preceded by y if and only if the time point at which y ends is before or equivalent to the time point at which x starts. Formally: x preceded by y iff ω(y) &lt;= α(x), where α is a function that maps a process to a start point, and ω is a function that maps a process to an end point.</owl:annotatedTarget>
