        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A flow battery is a battery in which chemical energy is provided by two chemical components dissolved in liquids contained within the system and separated by a membrane. Ion exchange (accompanied by flow of electric current) occurs through the membrane while both liquids circulate in their own respective space.</obo:IAO_0000115>
