        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Lignite is coal that is non-agglomerating with a gross calorific value less than 17 435 kJ/kg (4 165 kcal/kg) and greater than 31 % volatile matter on a dry mineral matter free basis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
