        <obo:IAO_0000115>A potential energy storage object is an energy storage object that has the function to store potential energy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000116>This object was introduce for the sake of completeness, but there is no actual use case seen at the moment.</obo:IAO_0000116>
