        <obo:IAO_0000115>An economic flow potential is a type of flow potential that identifies the proportion of the technological potential that can be utilised economically (based on economic boundary conditions).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">economic flow potential</rdfs:label>
        <OEO_00020426>issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/481
