        <obo:IAO_0000115>A secondary control is a frequency control that is centralised and automated. It refers to the control area of one transmission system operator. Secondary control succeeds primary control and operates for several minutes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000118 xml:lang="de">Sekundärregelung</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">secondary control</rdfs:label>
