        <obo:IAO_0000115>A tertiary control is a frequency control that is either automated or manual. It takes over from secondary control to equalise electricity supply and demand imbalances that last for more than 15 minutes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000118 xml:lang="de">Minutenreserve</obo:IAO_0000118>
