        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A gross national electricity consumption value is an energy consumption value measuring the consumption of electrical energy in a spatial region (e.g. a country), including gross electricity generation plus electricity imports, minus electricity exports. It is part of the gross inland energy consumption.</obo:IAO_0000115>
