        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Spatial planning policy is a policy of a German federal state that designates portions of a spatial region to purposes like settlement, infrastructur and sustainability.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">spatial planning policy</rdfs:label>
