            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Feasible potential determination process al is a process that follows a determination methodology for feasable potential to gain knowledge of the feasible potential of something.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">feasible potental determination process</rdfs:label>
        <OEO_00020426>Add:
