        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A bird sanctuary role is a protected area role for areas, aimed at protecting and conserving endangered and migratory bird species, within the European &quot;Natura 2000&quot; network of protected areas.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>See German nature conservation law: § 31 ff. BNatSchG, Netz „Natura 2000“: https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/bnatschg_2009/BJNR254210009.html#BJNR254210009BJNG000600000</obo:IAO_0000119>
