            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A protected landscape area role is a protected area role for areas, aimed at conserving and enhancing the natural and cultural landscape, while allowing for sustainable land use and recreational activities.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>See German nature conservation law: § 26 BNatSchG: https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/bnatschg_2009/__26.html</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">protected landscape area role</rdfs:label>
