            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A water protection area role is a protected area role for areas, aimed at safeguarding the quality and quantity of water resources, including surface water and groundwater.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>See German water resources act: 
§ 51 WHG: https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/whg_2009/__51.html
§ 52 WHG: https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/whg_2009/__52.html</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">water protection area role</rdfs:label>
