        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Gain of Realizable Entity</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A Gain of Specifically Dependent Continuant in which some Independent Continuant becomes the bearer of some Realizable Entity.</skos:definition>
