        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">For the most part Generically Dependent Continuants do not inhere in their bearers over some continuous scale. The primary exception is religion and this class allows annotation of those cases where an Agent is described as becoming less religious. Other cases would include the decrease of an organization&apos;s bearing of some objective.</rdfs:comment>
