        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A Decrease of Dependent Continuant in which some Independent Continuant has a decrease in the level of a Generically Dependent Continuant that it bears.</skos:definition>
        <www:ont00001760 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/EventOntology</www:ont00001760>
