        <OEO_00000504 rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000242"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) &apos;petroleum refining&apos; is an energy transformation sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
All combustion activities supporting the refining of petroleum products including on-site combustion for the generation of electricity and heat for own use.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories, Volume 2, Chapter 2.2, https://www.ipcc-nggip.iges.or.jp/public/2006gl/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">CRF sector (IPCC 2006): petroleum refining</rdfs:label>
