        <obo:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) &apos;oil and natural gas&apos; is a sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
Comprises fugitive emissions from all oil and natural gas activities.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories, Volume 1, Chapter 8.5, https://www.ipcc-nggip.iges.or.jp/public/2006gl/</obo:IAO_0000119>
