        <obo:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) &apos;solid waste disposal&apos; is a waste and wastewater sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
Methane is produced from anaerobic microbial decomposition of organic matter in solid waste disposal sites.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories, Volume 1, Chapter 8.5, https://www.ipcc-nggip.iges.or.jp/public/2006gl/</obo:IAO_0000119>
