        <obo:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) &apos;biological treatment of solid waste&apos; is a waste and wastewater sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
Solid waste composting and other biological treatment. Emissions from biogas facilities (anaerobic digestion) with energy production are reported in the Energy Sector (1A4).</obo:IAO_0000115>
