        <obo:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006): &apos;CO2 captured&apos; is a sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories: It encompasses the total amount of CO2 captured for storage.</obo:IAO_0000115>
